<section class="dak-page-hero"><div class="container dak-page-hero-grid"><div class="dak-page-hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">South Africa Customs requirement</div><h1>SARS online Traveller Declaration from 1 July 2026.</h1><p class="lead">Travellers entering or leaving South Africa are generally required to submit the online Traveller Declaration before travelling.</p><div class="dak-page-actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://tools.sars.gov.za/sarsonlinequery/traveller">Official declaration</a><a class="btn btn--outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.sars.gov.za/travellerdeclaration/faqs-for-the-required-online-traveller-declarations-from-1-july-2026/">Official SARS FAQs</a></div></div><?php echo wp_kses_post( daktravel_media_slot( 'daktravel_contact_image', 'Aircraft wing above the clouds', 'South Africa traveller information', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1436491865332-7a61a109cc05?auto=format&fit=crop&fm=jpg&q=82&w=1800' ) ); ?></div></section>
<section class="dak-intro-section"><div class="container dak-narrow"><div class="eyebrow">Before you travel</div><h2>Who needs to complete it?</h2><p class="lead">The requirement generally applies to South African citizens, residents and foreign travellers entering or leaving South Africa by air, land, sea or rail.</p><div class="dak-feature-list"><div class="dak-feature-row"><span class="num">01</span><strong>Arriving or departing</strong><p>The declaration applies in both directions.</p></div><div class="dak-feature-row"><span class="num">02</span><strong>Transit exception</strong><p>Air or sea passengers who remain entirely in the designated transit area are excluded.</p></div><div class="dak-feature-row"><span class="num">03</span><strong>Timing</strong><p>Submit no more than 24 hours before departure. For a connecting journey into South Africa, use the final direct leg to South Africa.</p></div><div class="dak-feature-row"><span class="num">04</span><strong>Use SARS directly</strong><p>Complete the declaration on the official SARS portal and keep the confirmation available.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--ivory"><div class="container dak-narrow"><div class="eyebrow">Official links</div><h2>South African Revenue Service</h2><p class="lead">D.A.K can remind you of the requirement, but the declaration is submitted directly to SARS and the traveller is responsible for the information provided.</p><p><a class="btn btn--primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://tools.sars.gov.za/sarsonlinequery/traveller">Complete Traveller Declaration</a></p><a class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.sars.gov.za/travellerdeclaration/faqs-for-the-required-online-traveller-declarations-from-1-july-2026/">Read official SARS FAQs</a></div></section>
